<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Portfolio Operator | Gamified Career System</title>

<style>

:root{
    --bg:#070b10;
    --surface:#101720;
    --surface2:#151f2b;
    --surface3:#0c131b;

    --green:#22c55e;
    --lime:#a3e635;
    --blue:#38bdf8;
    --gold:#facc15;
    --red:#f87171;

    --text:#f8fafc;
    --muted:#94a3b8;
    --border:#243241;

    --shadow:0 15px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    font-family:"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%,rgba(34,197,94,.08),transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(56,189,248,.07),transparent 30%),
        var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.65;
}

button{
    font-family:inherit;
}

.container{
    width:min(1150px,92%);
    margin:auto;
}

/* =========================
PLAYER BAR
========================= */

.player-bar{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:1000;
    background:rgba(7,11,16,.94);
    backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.player-inner{
    width:min(1150px,92%);
    margin:auto;
    min-height:72px;

    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;

    gap:20px;
}

.player-brand{
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.05em;
}

.player-brand span{
    color:var(--lime);
}

.player-stats{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:18px;
}

.stat{
    text-align:center;
}

.stat strong{
    display:block;
    color:var(--lime);
    font-size:1.05rem;
}

.stat small{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.65rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}

.rank{
    padding:7px 12px;
    border:1px solid rgba(163,230,53,.4);
    color:var(--lime);
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

/* =========================
HERO
========================= */

.hero{
    padding:100px 20px 70px;
    text-align:center;
}

.kicker{
    display:inline-block;
    color:var(--lime);
    font-size:.72rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.15em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero h1{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;

    font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.8rem);
    line-height:.98;

    letter-spacing:-.05em;
}

.hero h1 span{
    background:linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--lime),
        var(--green),
        var(--blue)
    );

    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:750px;
    margin:30px auto;

    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:1.1rem;
}

.hero-actions{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:15px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.btn{
    border:0;
    cursor:pointer;

    padding:15px 25px;

    border-radius:10px;

    font-weight:800;

    text-decoration:none;

    display:inline-block;

    transition:.25s;
}

.btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
}

.btn-primary{
    color:#07100b;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            var(--lime),
            var(--green)
        );
}

.btn-secondary{
    color:white;

    background:var(--surface2);

    border:1px solid var(--border);
}

/* =========================
DASHBOARD
========================= */

.dashboard{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap:15px;
    margin-bottom:70px;
}

.dashboard-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:22px;
}

.dashboard-card small{
    color:var(--muted);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:.65rem;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
}

.dashboard-card strong{
    display:block;
    font-size:1.8rem;
    margin-top:5px;
    color:var(--lime);
}

.dashboard-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.78rem;
}

/* =========================
XP
========================= */

.progress-panel{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:25px;
    margin-bottom:70px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.progress-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:12px;
}

.progress-top strong{
    color:var(--lime);
}

.progress-track{
    height:14px;
    background:#05090d;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.progress-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0%;
    background:linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--green),
        var(--lime)
    );
    transition:.6s;
}

/* =========================
SECTION
========================= */

section{
    margin-bottom:90px;
}

.section-heading{
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.section-heading small{
    color:var(--lime);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    font-size:.7rem;
}

.section-heading h2{
    font-size:2.4rem;
    margin-top:5px;
}

.section-heading p{
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:750px;
}

/* =========================
MISSIONS
========================= */

.mission-board{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
    gap:18px;
}

.mission{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:25px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.mission:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px);
    border-color:var(--green);
    box-shadow:
        0 10px 35px
        rgba(34,197,94,.08);
}

.mission.complete{
    border-color:var(--lime);

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            #111d17,
            #101720
        );
}

.mission.complete::after{
    content:"✓ COMPLETE";

    position:absolute;

    top:15px;
    right:15px;

    color:var(--lime);

    font-size:.62rem;

    font-weight:900;
}

.mission-number{
    color:var(--green);
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:.72rem;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
}

.mission h3{
    margin:12px 0 8px;
}

.mission p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.88rem;
}

.mission-reward{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:18px;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:.75rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

.mission button{
    margin-top:18px;
    width:100%;
    background:var(--surface2);
    color:white;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:10px;
    border-radius:8px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.mission button:hover{
    border-color:var(--lime);
}

.mission button:disabled{
    opacity:.6;
    cursor:default;
}

/* =========================
LEVEL ROADMAP
========================= */

.level-roadmap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));
    gap:12px;
}

.level-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:20px;
    position:relative;
    transition:.3s;
}

.level-card.current{
    border-color:var(--lime);
    box-shadow:
        0 0 25px
        rgba(163,230,53,.08);
}

.level-card.unlocked{
    opacity:1;
}

.level-card.locked{
    opacity:.4;
}

.level-card small{
    color:var(--muted);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:.65rem;
}

.level-card h3{
    margin:6px 0;
    color:var(--lime);
}

.level-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.78rem;
}

/* =========================
SCORE
========================= */

.score-layout{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;
    gap:25px;
}

.score-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:35px;
    text-align:center;
}

.score-circle{
    width:190px;
    height:190px;
    border-radius:50%;
    margin:auto auto 25px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle,
            var(--surface) 62%,
            transparent 63%
        ),
        conic-gradient(
            var(--lime) 0deg,
            #1c2934 0deg
        );
}

.score-number{
    font-size:3.3rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

.score-label{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.75rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}

.score-bars{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:18px;
}

.score-row{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:18px;
    border-radius:12px;
}

.score-row-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.score-row-top span{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.85rem;
}

.mini-track{
    height:8px;
    background:#05090d;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.mini-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0;
    background:var(--green);
    transition:.6s;
}

/* =========================
BLUEPRINT
========================= */

.blueprint{
    display:grid;
    gap:15px;
}

.blueprint-step{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:70px 1fr auto;
    gap:20px;
    align-items:center;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:22px;
    border-radius:14px;
}

.blueprint-num{
    width:48px;
    height:48px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#102318;
    border:1px solid var(--green);
    color:var(--lime);
    font-weight:900;
}

.blueprint-step p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.9rem;
}

.tag{
    padding:5px 9px;
    border-radius:20px;
    background:#15221b;
    color:var(--lime);
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:800;
}

/* =========================
EXPLORER
========================= */

.explorer{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:25px;
}

.tabs{
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.tab{
    padding:10px 15px;
    border-radius:8px;
    background:var(--surface3);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    color:var(--muted);
    cursor:pointer;
    font-weight:700;
}

.tab.active{
    background:var(--green);
    color:#061008;
    border-color:var(--green);
}

.explorer-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:15px;
}

.explorer-card{
    background:var(--surface3);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:20px;
}

.explorer-card small{
    color:var(--lime);
    font-weight:900;
}

.explorer-card h3{
    margin:10px 0;
}

.explorer-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.88rem;
}

.takeaway{
    margin-top:15px;
    border-left:3px solid var(--green);
    padding-left:10px;
    color:#dce7df;
    font-size:.78rem;
}

/* =========================
ACHIEVEMENTS
========================= */

.achievements{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));
    gap:15px;
}

.achievement{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:22px;
    border-radius:14px;
    opacity:.4;
    filter:grayscale(1);
    transition:.4s;
}

.achievement.unlocked{
    opacity:1;
    filter:none;
    border-color:var(--lime);
    box-shadow:
        0 0 25px
        rgba(163,230,53,.08);
}

.achievement-icon{
    font-size:2rem;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.achievement h3{
    font-size:1rem;
}

.achievement p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.8rem;
}

/* =========================
AUDIT
========================= */

.audit{
    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            #101a16,
            #101720
        );

    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:30px;
}

.audit-item{
    display:flex;
    gap:15px;
    padding:18px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.audit-item:last-child{
    border-bottom:0;
}

.audit-item input{
    width:20px;
    height:20px;
    accent-color:var(--green);
}

.audit-item label{
    cursor:pointer;
}

.audit-item strong{
    display:block;
}

.audit-item span{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.82rem;
}

/* =========================
7 DAY CHALLENGE
========================= */

.challenge{
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 80% 20%,
            rgba(163,230,53,.12),
            transparent 35%
        ),
        var(--surface);

    border:1px solid var(--green);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:45px;
    text-align:center;
}

.challenge h2{
    font-size:2.6rem;
}

.challenge p{
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:700px;
    margin:15px auto 25px;
}

.challenge-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:12px;
    margin:30px 0;
}

.challenge-day{
    background:var(--surface3);
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.25s;
}

.challenge-day:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    border-color:var(--green);
}

.challenge-day.done{
    border-color:var(--lime);
    background:#122018;
}

.challenge-day strong{
    color:var(--lime);
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.challenge-day span{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.8rem;
}

/* =========================
BOSS
========================= */

.boss{
    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            #20150b,
            #101720
        );

    border:1px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:40px;
    text-align:center;
}

.boss .boss-icon{
    font-size:3.5rem;
}

.boss h2{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:2.5rem;
    margin:10px 0;
}

.boss p{
    max-width:700px;
    margin:15px auto;
    color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
RESET
========================= */

.reset-area{
    text-align:center;
    margin:30px 0 70px;
}

.reset-btn{
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--red);
    border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.35);
    padding:10px 16px;
    border-radius:8px;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-size:.75rem;
}

.reset-btn:hover{
    background:rgba(248,113,113,.08);
}

/* =========================
TOAST
========================= */

.toast{
    position:fixed;
    right:25px;
    bottom:25px;
    z-index:2000;

    background:#101a15;
    border:1px solid var(--lime);
    color:white;

    padding:16px 20px;

    border-radius:12px;

    box-shadow:var(--shadow);

    transform:translateY(120px);
    opacity:0;

    transition:.4s;

    pointer-events:none;

    max-width:320px;
}

.toast.show{
    transform:translateY(0);
    opacity:1;
}

.toast strong{
    color:var(--lime);
    display:block;
}

/* =========================
FOOTER
========================= */

footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:60px 20px;
    text-align:center;
}

footer h2{
    font-size:2rem;
}

footer p{
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:650px;
    margin:15px auto;
}

/* =========================
MOBILE
========================= */

@media(max-width:800px){

    .player-stats{
        gap:8px;
    }

    .player-stats .stat:nth-child(2),
    .player-stats .stat:nth-child(3){
        display:none;
    }

    .dashboard{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .score-layout{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .explorer-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .blueprint-step{
        grid-template-columns:55px 1fr;
    }

    .blueprint-step .tag{
        grid-column:2;
        width:max-content;
    }

    .challenge-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    }

}

@media(max-width:500px){

    .challenge-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .hero{
        padding-top:70px;
    }

    .section-heading h2{
        font-size:2rem;
    }

    .challenge{
        padding:30px 20px;
    }

    .challenge h2{
        font-size:2rem;
    }

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<nav class="player-bar">

<div class="player-inner">

<div class="player-brand">
PORTFOLIO<span>OS</span>
</div>

<div class="player-stats">

<div class="stat">
<strong id="xp">0</strong>
<small>Proof XP</small>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong id="level">1</strong>
<small>Level</small>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong id="completed">0/8</strong>
<small>Missions</small>
</div>

<div class="rank" id="rank">
STARTER
</div>

</div>

</div>

</nav>

<main class="container">

<header class="hero">

<div class="kicker">
Portfolio Operator Training System
</div>

<h1>
Build Work That Is
<span>Impossible to Ignore.</span>
</h1>

<p>
A portfolio is not a collection of pretty pages.
It is an evidence system that makes your ability visible.
Complete missions, create proof, strengthen your portfolio,
and progress from learner to verified operator.
</p>

<div class="hero-actions">

<button
class="btn btn-primary"
onclick="scrollToSection('missions')">
Begin Portfolio Mission </button>

<button
class="btn btn-secondary"
onclick="scrollToSection('audit')">
Run Portfolio Audit </button>

</div>

</header>

<!-- DASHBOARD -->

<div class="dashboard">

<div class="dashboard-card">

<small>Current Objective</small>

<strong id="objective">
Define the Battlefield
</strong>

<p>
Complete your next available mission.
</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<small>Portfolio Strength</small>

<strong>
<span id="dashboardScore">0</span>/100
</strong>

<p>
Evidence-based portfolio score.
</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<small>Streak</small>

<strong>
🔥 <span id="streak">0</span> Days
</strong>

<p>
Keep building consistently.
</p>

</div>

</div>

<!-- XP -->

<div class="progress-panel">

<div class="progress-top">

<span>
Level <span id="currentLevel">1</span> Progress
</span>

<strong>
<span id="xpProgress">0</span> /
<span id="nextXP">200</span> XP
</strong>

</div>

<div class="progress-track">

<div
class="progress-fill"
id="progressFill">
</div>

</div>

</div>

<!-- MISSIONS -->

<section id="missions">

<div class="section-heading">

<small>Mission Control</small>

<h2>Complete the Portfolio Missions</h2>

<p>
Stop reading passively. Each mission produces evidence
that can become part of a professional case study.
</p>

</div>

<div class="mission-board">

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 01</div>

<h3>Define the Battlefield</h3>

<p>
Document the original problem, constraints, resources,
knowledge gaps, and conditions you started with.
</p>

<span class="mission-reward">+100 Proof XP</span>

<button onclick="completeMission(this)">
Complete Mission
</button>

</div>

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 02</div>

<h3>Expose the Friction</h3>

<p>
Identify the specific obstacle that prevented the desired
result and explain why it mattered.
</p>

<span class="mission-reward">+100 Proof XP</span>

<button onclick="completeMission(this)">
Complete Mission
</button>

</div>

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 03</div>

<h3>Log the Work</h3>

<p>
Create a visible record of iterations, mistakes, corrections,
experiments, and decisions.
</p>

<span class="mission-reward">+100 Proof XP</span>

<button onclick="completeMission(this)">
Complete Mission
</button>

</div>

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 04</div>

<h3>Ship the Artifact</h3>

<p>
Produce something functional: a website, system, analysis,
design, research output, repair, or operational improvement.
</p>

<span class="mission-reward">+100 Proof XP</span>

<button onclick="completeMission(this)">
Complete Mission
</button>

</div>

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 05</div>

<h3>Measure the Result</h3>

<p>
Find numbers, before-and-after comparisons, performance data,
or other evidence showing what changed.
</p>

<span class="mission-reward">+100 Proof XP</span>

<button onclick="completeMission(this)">
Complete Mission
</button>

</div>

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 06</div>

<h3>Explain the Decision</h3>

<p>
Show why you selected your approach and what trade-offs
you considered.
</p>

<span class="mission-reward">+100 Proof XP</span>

<button onclick="completeMission(this)">
Complete Mission
</button>

</div>

<div class="mission" data-xp="100">

<div class="mission-number">MISSION 07</div>

